   "text": "SPARK / ORB OF STORMS / COC COMET — Philosophy: Spark + Orb of Storms clear the map. Comet is the nuke for rares, rituals, juiced content, bosses.",
   "originalText": "SPARK / ORB OF STORMS / COC COMET — Philosophy: Spark + Orb of Storms clear the map. Comet is the nuke for rares, rituals, juiced content, bosses.",
